<title>USA: Citation Corp Q4 Sept 29 net falls.</title>
<headline>Citation Corp Q4 Sept 29 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary Earnings Highlights</p>
<p>(All figures except eps and shares outstanding in thousands)</p>
<p>					     Fiscal Year Ended</p>
<p>					     Sep 29,     Oct. 1,</p>
<p>						 1996	  1995</p>
<p> Sales				     487,753     307,681</p>
<p> Net Income				 16,742	17,079</p>
<p> Earnings per Share			$0.95	 $1.27</p>
<p>Avg. Number of</p>
<p> Shares Outstanding		 17,693,974  13,437,900</p>
<p>					     Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					     Sep 29,     Oct. 1,</p>
<p>						 1996	  1995</p>
<p> Sales				     131,617	92,096</p>
<p> Net Income				  1,414	 4,803</p>
<p> Earnings per Share			$0.08	 $0.34</p>
<p>Avg. Number of</p>
<p> Shares Outstanding		 17,715,540  13,971,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 shr includes a $0.06 per share loss on the sale of Pennsylvania Steel and was calculated on the basis of four million additional shares of stock after a secondary offering.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
